WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
[CLICK]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[WHISPERING]
That’s too loud.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.500
&lt;I&gt;You’re going to whisper into your microphone&lt;/I&gt;

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.500
&lt;I&gt;whatever comes into your mind, you think is going to relax the other person.&lt;/I&gt;

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:10.850
[WHISPERING]
Hold my hand.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.850
[WHISPERING]
Is this ASMR?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.750
[LAUGHS]

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.500
[WHISPERING]
It’s been a long day at work

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[WHISPERING]
and now, you’re home.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.000
[WHISPERING]
… And I’m waiting for you.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.500
[WHISPERING]
Waiting for you at your house.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[WHISPERING]
You’re in the center

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.750
[WHISPERING]
of a jelly-filled 

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
[WHISPERING]
doughnut.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.500
[WHISPERING]
Is it bad that I just…

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.750
[WHISPERING]
wanted to eat the doughnut?

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.250
[LAUGHS]

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.500
[WHISPERING]
How was that?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.500
[LAUGHS]

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.250
[WHISPERING]
I thought you were gonna say… 

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:33.850
[LAUGHS]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.500
[WHISPERING]
you were waiting to kill me!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.000
[LAUGHS]

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.000
[WHISPERING]
We’re going to use Zippo lighters to make ASMR sounds.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.000
[CLICKS]

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.500
[WHISPERING]
Oh, wow!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.250
[SCRATCHING]

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.500
[WHISPERING]
Ohhh.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.600
[WHISPERING]
– Yours was built for rubbing.
– Right?

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.500
[CRACKLE]

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.500
[WHISPERING]
Ooh, see, that is like being in front of a fire.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.750
[WHISPERING]
And the kids, were never heard from again.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.000
[BLOWING]

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.000
[WHISPERING]
All your ASMRs are really creepy.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.850
[LAUGHS]

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.000
[CLICK]

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.500
[WHISPERING]
Oooohhhhhh!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
[WHISPERING]
Now we’re going to try to make ASMR

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:06.750
[WHISPERING]
with scissors and paper.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.750
[SNIP]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.500
[WHISPERING]
It sounds like the wind is really blowing and you’re like–

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.000
[RUSTLE]

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.000
[WHISPERING]
“The view up here’s really amazing!”

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.500
[WHISPERING]
This isn’t giving me tingles, it’s just fun to cut stuff.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.000
[FURIOUS CUTTING]

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.500
[WHISPERING]
Robin!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.950
[WHISPERING]
It definitely made me feel very weird

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
[WHISPERING]
and also, whispering’s not easy. My throat hurts.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.500
[WHISPERING]
It takes you away from, like, all of the daily thoughts that you have.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:33.000
[WHISPERING]
You can just let yourself rely on your senses, entirely.

